  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">A function, defined by \(p(600−60p)\), describes the revenue collected from the sales of tickets for a concert where \(p\) is the price of one ticket. Find the maximum revenue, in dollars.</para>
  </section>
</content>
